  "heading": null,
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{Axiom Schema of Replacement}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "Axiom:\ngiven:\n. A is \\set\n. phi(x_, y_) is (_ is \\set, _ is \\set) -> (_ is \\\\statement)\nwhere:\n. forAll: x \"in\" A\n  then:\n  . existsUnique: y is \\set\n    suchThat: phi(x, y)\nthen:\n. exists: B is \\set\n  suchThat:\n  . forAll: y is \\set\n    then:\n    . have: y \"in\" B\n      iff:\n      . exists: x \"in\" A\n        suchThat: phi(x, y)\nDocumented:\n. called: \"Axiom Schema of Replacement\"\n. description: \"The image of a set under a formula that assigns each input a\n                unique output is again a set.\"\nId: \"6e09ea04-f1dd-41c0-a0f5-4c962cd819ac\"",
